    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"What urge will save us\n\nnow that sex won't?\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1983, 1985",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/speech-acts/questions/2004holzerXenonForDC-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "230",
      "height": "187",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"When you place your hand on the Bible,\n\ndo you think about eternal questions:\n\n\nwhy are we here instead of nothing?\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2004",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Barbara Kruger",
      "links": [],
      "level": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Untitled",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1991",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/speech-acts/questions/91kruger%5BQuestions%28Flag%29%5D-s.gif",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "230",
      "height": "165",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Look for the moment when pride becomes contempt.\n\nWho is free to choose? Who is beyond the law?\n\nWho is healed? Who is housed?\n\nWho speaks? Who is silenced?\n\nWho salutes longest? Who prays loudest?\n\nWho dies first? Who laughs last?",
      "links": []
    }
